## Boundary

This validation certifies byte/hash bindings, exact-decimal dose arithmetic, formula hash closure, artifact rebinding, workbook consistency, and preservation of the V19/V20 authority boundary. It does not establish formula authority, physical compounding, liking, similarity, measured headspace, strict empirical OAV, stability, safety, installation, publication, or release.
